es, mixed reality gameplay, fitness features, and introductory training\u2014all from the comfort of your home.\n{638775075561987}\n# WHAT'S INCLUDED IN THE DEMO:\n- **Realistic Physics**: Experience authentic, responsive gameplay.\n- **Single-player Matches**: Enjoy practice and competitive match scenarios.\n- **Mixed Reality Gameplay**: Immerse yourself in a unique blend of virtual and real-world play.\n- **Fitness and Training**: Experience introductory fitness features and targeted practice.\n{581303474955457}\n\n# UPGRADE FOR FULL ACCESS: \nUnlock multiplayer matches, ranked competition, comprehensive training modules, ongoing content updates, and become part of our vibrant, engaging pickleball community.\n\n{2071089853326010}\n# COMMON QUESTIONS:\n**Does the demo require a lot of space?** No. Pickleball One Demo is designed for home use, requiring minimal space.\n\n**How do I upgrade to the full game?** Upgrade directly within the app or visit www.pickleballone.app to join the full experience.\n\n**Need help or have questions?** Join our community on Discord or reach us at support@playingames.net.\n\n\n", "short_description": "EXPERIENCE THE FUTURE OF PICKLEBALL\nPickleball One Demo gives you a 14-Day glimpse of the exciting gameplay and community that awaits. Explore cutting-edge VR physics, single-player matches, mixed reality gameplay, fitness features, and introductory training\u2014all from the comfort of your home.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://pickleballone.app/privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Future World Software", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://pickleballone.app/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [],